0\cf0\charscalex108\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 action: [Snoopy run: Script peek aslnteger].\line Snoopy learn: 'run inside kennel'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1354\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex108\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 action: [Snoopy bounce: Script peek aslnteger].\line \expndtw-1 Snoopy learn: 'walk'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi1746\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx1350 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex108\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 action: [Snoopy walk: Script peek aslnteger].\line \charscalex35\expndtw8 j! \dbch\af3\loch\af1\hich\f1\cchs0 \u9632\'3f{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\charscalex108\expndtw-1\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0 Snoopy learn: 'direction'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\tx2455\tx6214 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs8 lit \super ]{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\nosupersub\expndtw0 r{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }l}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1354\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex108\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 action: [Snoopy direction: Script peek aslnteger J.\line Snoopy learn: 'turn'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1746\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex108\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 action: [Snoopy turn: Script peek aslnteger].}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1823\margrsxn2472\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 Chapter 10: Windows    U3}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li22\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Finally, evaluate the following expression to open the new window with a starting script:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi-400\ri0\sb122\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Kennel openOn:\line 'Snoopy home\line \expndtw-6 Lassie home\line \expndtw5 Wow home\line \expndtw0 Snoopy top speed 40\line \expndtw-2 Lassie top speed 30\line \expndtw4 Wow top speed 20\line \expndtw-1 Snoopy bark a little\line \expndtw-4 Lassie bark a little\line \expndtw3 Wow bark a lot\line \expndtw-1 Snoopy direction 45\line \expndtw0 Snoopy walk 200\line \expndtw-3 Snoopy talk\line \expndtw-4 Lassie direction 90\line Lassie walk 150\line \expndtw-8 Lassie talk\line \expndtw-5 Lassie turn 225\line \expndtw-4 Lassie run 150\line \expndtw-7 Lassie talk\line \expndtw3 Wow direction 0\line \expndtw6 Wow walk 300\line \expndtw4 Wow talk\line Wow turn 135\line \expndtw5 Wow run 250\line Wow talk\line \expndtw-2 Snoopy run inside kennel 4000 feet*}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb148\sa0\sl-241\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Pop up the pane menu of the input pane and select the \b play all \b0 choice to play the entire\line \expndtw-3 script. You see the dogs' dialogue in the reply pane, and their performance in the graph\line \expndtw0 pane. The final window is shown in the following picture.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1150\margrsxn1845\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1332\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa742 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 1\}4    Chapter 10: Windows}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2802\margrsxn1939\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols3\colno1\colw946\colsr1130\colno2\colw2322\colsr1177\colno3\colw1591 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft1966\shptop-248\shpright4781\shpbottom-248\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 13970}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft1958\shptop-248\shpright1958\shpbottom1682\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 11430}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \s