}}}{\sp{\sn pictureGray}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn pWrapPolygonVertices}{\sv 8;25;(4433,0);(4433,2344);(4433,2344);(4433,5358);(4433,5358);(4433,7646);(4433,7646);(4433,8372);(0,8372);(0,8874);(0,8874);(0,21600);(17166,21600);(17166,8874);(16187,8874);(16187,8372);(16187,8372);(16187,7646);(16135,7646);(16135,5358);(21600,5358);(21600,2344);(16135,2344);(16135,0);(4433,0)}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fIsBullet}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fAllowOverlap}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fEditedWrap}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fBehindDocument}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fPrint}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn dxWrapDistLeft}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn dxWrapDistRight}{\sv 0}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb1361\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Figure 12.3}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Menus Enrich \b SalesCom \b0 Window}\par \column {\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi212\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-194\slmult0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phcol\posnegx788\posnegy2318\absw375\absh-417\nowrap\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0\box\brdrs\brdrw20\brsp20 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex87\expndtw0\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1031\fs18  \i\lang1033 f\line \i0\expndtw-17\lang1031  \i\lang1033 Phone}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-184\slmult0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phcol\posnegx317\posnegy2527\absw432\absh-371\nowrap\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i\ul\cf0\charscalex87\expndtw-17\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 change\line \ul0\charscalex100\expndtw-2 print i}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phcol\posnegx281\posnegy2693\absw0\absh-216\nowrap\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i\cf0\charscalex87\expndtw7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 print Detail}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-140\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex95\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 D\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\f2\cchs0 \'a3\hich\af0\dbch\af2\loch\f0\cchs0 F Corp,\line \expndtw-7 Jam Dot\line \expndtw-9 521 Poplar Terr.\line \expndtw4 Hkhsvilk MD 21202.\line \expndtw12 555-5476}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1987\margrsxn2283\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li29\fi0\ri0\sb25\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 it takes to get a prototype to look and behave like the design so far, would it do anything\line \expndtw0 interesting and useful?" When your answer is affirmative, go to it. \b Smalltalk/\b0 V is designed to\line \expndtw-1 work with you in an evolving, incremental process.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li14\fi0\ri22\sb148\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 As they prepared to begin development, the reps took a couple of minutes to draft a list\line \expndtw-1 of the classes involved in the SalesCom application:}\par {\pntext\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb151\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22  \'95\tab}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb151\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \f3\fs20{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart-1\pnindent213\pnf3{\pntxtb \'95}}\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 SalesCom, the sales communication application and window model class}\par {\pntext\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22  \'95\tab}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \f3\fs20{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart-1\pnindent213\pnf3{\pntxtb \'95}}\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 {\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ComEvent, \b0 the class of communication events}\par {\pntext\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22  \'95\tab}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \f3\fs20{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart-1\pnindent213\pnf3{\pntxtb \'95}}\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Network, the network of ComEvents which make up a sales strategy}\par {\pntext\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22  \'95\tab}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \f3\fs20{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart-1\pnindent213\pnf3{\pntxtb \'95}}\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 {\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Dictionary, \b0 to associate customer names and customer data}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb367\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Getting There in Half the Time: \b0\i Recycling Code}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri25\sb223\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The reps set to work on a kind of scavenger hunt for reusable code to get the \b SalesCom\line \b0\expndtw1 application up and running as soon as possible. You can recreate their exploratory\line \expndtw-4 process by opening a Class Hierarchy Browser and use your Disk Browser to open the\line \b\expndtw-5 chapter. 12 \b0 tutorial file.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li11\fi0\ri22\sb144\sa0\sl-241\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 As you do more \b Smalltalk/V \b0 programming you will see that you re-use code in two\line \expndtw-6 basic ways:}\par {\pntext\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb158\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22  \'95\tab}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb158\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \f3\fs20{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart-1\pnindent213\pnf3{\pntxtb \'95}}\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 indirectly through inheritance when creating new subclasses, and}\par {\pntext\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li623\fi-212\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22  \'95\tab}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li623\fi-212\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx623 \f3\fs20{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnstart-1\pnindent212\pnf3{\pntxtb \'95}}\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 through cut and paste of methods from an existing class to a new,\line \expndtw-4 non-hierarchically related class.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1344\margrsxn1957\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-259\shptop-371\shpright-259\shpbottom7758\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 25400}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-122\shptop-371\shpright-122\shpbottom10897\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 20320}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1019\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 166    Chapter 12: Application Development: Case Study}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li994\fi0\ri4\sb299\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 You will use both methods in creating the SalesCom application, starting with the\line \expndtw-3 inheritance approach by creating a new class of object, \b ComEvent, \b0 as a subclass of the\line \b\expndtw-2 NetworkNode \b0 class. You will then go on a cut and paste "raid" on the \b AnimalHabitat\line \b0\expndtw0 class to borrow the basic window model for the three pane \b SalesCom \b0 application.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li994\fi0\ri0\sb148\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 If you have not done the tutorial examples in Chapters 6, 7, 9 and 10 and/or have not\line \expndtw0 saved the image along the way, you should add the following classes by evaluating:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1778\fi-392\ri0\sb151\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Object subclass: # NetworkNode\line \expndtw-9 instance VariableNames:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1778\fi414\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 'name position'\line \expndtw-9 class VariableNames: "\line \expndtw0 poolDictionaries: \b0 "}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li986\fi0\ri0\sb137\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Then select and evaluate:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1782\fi-400\ri0\sb151\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Object subclass: # Network\line \expndtw-9 instance VariableNames:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1775\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 'connections'\line \expndtw-7 class VariableNames: \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0 \'b0\line \expndtw0\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0 poolDictionaries: \b0 "}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li990\fi0\ri0\sb133\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 and evaluate:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1782\fi-400\ri0\sb158\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Object subclass: # AnimalHabitat\line \expndtw-9 instance VariableNames:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1771\fi414\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 'animals replyStream animator inputString inputPane'\line \expndtw-8 class VariableNames: "\line \expndtw1 poolDictionaries: \b0 "}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-20\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 V.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li986\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Then select and evaluate the following to file in the relevant methods for these three}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li990\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 classes. This is to give you a starting point equivalent to where the sales reps started.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1390\fi0\ri0\sb144\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 (File pathName: 'network9.st') nleln.\line \expndtw0 (File pathName: 'nodes9.st') nleln.\line \expndtw-1 (File pathName: 'classlO.st') nleln.\line \expndtw-2 (File pathName: 'animallO.st') nleln.\line \expndtw0 (File pathName: 'window4.st') nleln.\line (File pathName: 'window5.st') fileln.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li994\fi0\ri0\sb137\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Update the class list pane of the Class Hierarchy Browser.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1001\fi0\ri0\sb364\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Re-working the Network of Nodes}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li986\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The starting point of the Network of Nodes example can be \i seen in \i0 Figure 9.2.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1960\margrsxn2332\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Chapter 12: Application Development: Case Study    167}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri4\sb306\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 As a first step, we create a new pool dictionary, \b SalesStrategy, \b0 to hold objects that will\line \expndtw-4 be global to our new application. Initially we create two new pool variables: \b StratNet \b0 to\line \expndtw0 hold the sales strategy network, and StratNodes to hold the nodes used in the sales\line \expndtw-2 strategy network. Evaluate the following:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb140\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 SalesStrategy := Dictionary new.\line \expndtw-8 SalesStrategy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 at: 'StratNet' put: Network new initialize;}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 at: 'StratNodes' put: Dictionary new}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1960\margrsxn2335\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb137\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The network node of the \b SalesCom \b0 marketing strategy diagram requires a richer data\line structure than the simple \b name \b0 and \b position \b0 instance variables defined for the path\line \expndtw0 computation and graphic display examples from earlier tutorial chapters. So we will\line \expndtw-2 create a \b ComEvent \b0 subclass of \b NetworkNode. \b0 In addition to a couple of new methods,\line \b a ComEvent \b0 has an \b info \b0 instance variable which is initialized as a \b Dictionary \b0 object.\line \b\expndtw-1 Info \b0 will be used to store information about the body of the letter or phone call script,\line \expndtw-4 the delay before the next event and a pointer to the next most likely event, etc. Select and\line \expndtw-7 evaluate:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb140\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 (File pathName: 'comevent.cls') fileln}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li4\fi0\ri0\sb151\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 We will use the pool variables \b StratNet \b0 and \b StratNodes \b0 to build a sales strategy network.\line \b\expndtw-3 StratNet \b0 and its nodes are given new names, positions and connections which transform\line the prior random network graphic example into the structured diagram of the \b SalesCom\line \b0\expndtw-1 marketing strategy. Evaluate the following to see the transformation:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li432\fi0\ri0\sb151\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx2578 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 # \b (('Kick-off Ltr'{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }180    20)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx2293 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ('Fol-UpLtr'{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw5 180 120)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx2290 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ('Phone Call'{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw5 180 180)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx2387 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ('Wake Up Ltr'       295 180)\line \expndtw-7 ('Exit Seminar'{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw6 57 240)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ('Exit Dead Leads'   280 240))}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 do: [-.nodelnfo I}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1202\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ComEvent new initialize;}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1595\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 name: (nodelnfo at: 1) position:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi1591\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 (nodelnfo at: 2) \i @ \i0 (nodelnfo at: 3)].\line \expndtw-3 (SalesStrategy at: 'StratNet') initialize.\line \expndtw-6 ComEvent}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phcol\posnegx3402\posnegy-40\absw1991\absh-1674\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 to: ' Fol-Up Ltr';\line \expndtw-4 to: 'Exit Seminar';\line \expndtw-2 to: 'Phone Call';\line \expndtw-5 to: 'Exit Seminar';\line \expndtw0 to: 'Wake Up Ltr';\line \expndtw-5 to: 'Exit Seminar';\line \expndtw-4 to: 'Exit Dead Leads'.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 connect: 'Kick-off Ltr'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 connect: 'Kick-off Ltr'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 connect: 'Fol-Up Ltr'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 connect: 'Fol-Up Ltr'}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri4856\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 connect: 'Phone Call'\line \expndtw-4 connect: 'Phone Call'\line connect: 'Phone Call'}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2343\margrsxn1945\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \