x100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Pen which is one of the animated objects that is currently moving.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 destForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi407\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 destX}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 destY}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 direction}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pen)\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 downState}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi410\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pen)\line \b\fs22 fractionX}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pen)\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 fractionY}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi403\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pen)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 halftone}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li817\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2336\margrsxn1934\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 312     Animation}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb324\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 height}\par