tBlt)\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 sourceY}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi403\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 speed}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Integer specifying the number of pixels to skip between successive}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 moves. Skipping a larger number of pixels gives the illusion of moving at a higher}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 speed.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 underForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Form used as an intermediate place for merging the erasing rectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 and the new displaying rectangle so that the blinking effect is reduced.\line \b\expndtw1\fs22 width}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb216\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 DoubleCenter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pen)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang