0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the background form to the contents of the display screen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 shiftRate: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Specify how many times the current picture will be copied before shifting to the\line \expndtw2 next one.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 speed: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Change the distance between consecutive copies to aninteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 tell: \b0 aName \b bounce: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tell the pen with the name aName to bounce by a distance of aninteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 tell: \b0 aName \b direction: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tell the pen with the name aName to change its direction to aninteger number of\line \expndtw-1 degrees.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 tell: \b0 aName go: aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tell the pen with the name aName to go for a distance of aninteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 tell: \b0 name \b goto: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tell the object with name to go to aPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 tell: \b0 aName place: aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tell the pen with the name aName to be placed at aPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 tell: \b0 aName \b turn: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tell the pen with the name aName to turn by aninteger number of degrees.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb288\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Array}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi0\ri14\sb202\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 An Array is a collection of any objects accessed through a fixed range of integer indices\line (representing the positions of the elements within the Array). Most of the protocol to handle\line \expndtw3 arrays is inherited from its superclasses. The only methods contained in this class are the\line \expndtw6 methods to print and store an Array on a stream.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb25\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2621 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw1 FixedSizeCollection IndexedCollection Collection Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2614 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited