d \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 color: \b0 aColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a mask form with aColor as the foreground color and black as the\line \expndtw2 background color.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 darkGray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a dark gray mask form.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 foreColor: \b0 aColor \b backColor: \b0 bColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a mask form with foreground aColor and background bColor.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2653\margrsxn1603\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li36\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 322     BiColorForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li428\fi0\ri0\sb299\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 gray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li828\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a gray mask form.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li428\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 UghtGray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li821\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a light gray mask form.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li432\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw14\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 new}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li824\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a new BiColorForm.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li428\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 white}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li824\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a white mask form.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li32\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li425\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 backColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li824\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the background color.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li425\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 backColor: \b0 aColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li821\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set receiver's background color to aColor.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li428\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 foreColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li817\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the foreground color.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li421\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 foreColor: \b0 aColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li821\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set receiver's foreground color to aColor.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li421\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 foreColor: \b0 aColor \b backColor: \b0 bColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li817\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set receiver's foreground color to aColor and background color to bColor.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 fromDisplay: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li814\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Copy aRectangle area of the display screen to receiver. Screen bits that are the\line \expndtw5 receiver foreground color become 1, the rest become 0.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li29\fi0\ri0\sb284\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 BitBIt}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa40\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 This class defines all the basic graphics operations. Its main function is to transfer bits from\line one area to another. This involves three forms: the source form, destination form, and mask\line \expndtw5 form. The bits in the source form are first ANDed with the bits in the mask form (tiled if\line size is smaller than the source rectangle), and then merged into the destination form with\line \expndtw1 a combination rule. The combination rule specifies a logical operation (e.g. AND, OR, XOR,\line \expndtw3 etc.) as to how to combine a masked source bit with its corresponding destination bit. The\line areas involved in this bit transfer are specified by a source rectangle on the source form, a\line \expndtw1 destination rectangle on the destination form, and a clipping rectangle also on the destination\line \expndtw3 form. After alligning the source rectangle origin with the destination rectangle origin, the\line \expndtw4 final affected area is the intersection of all three rectangles. The prebuilt mask forms and\line \expndtw5 supported combination rules can be obtained by sending class messages to Form or\line BiColorForm (if colors other than black and white are desired).}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgws