nsecutive elements of aCollection beginning at index position repStart. Answer\line \expndtw3 the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Character}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi0\ri4\sb202\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Character defines the protocol for all the characters in the system (ASCII codes from\line 0 to 255). Instances of this class are immutable, meaning that they cannot be removed and\line \expndtw6 new ones cannot be created. There is one and only one instance of each character in\line \expndtw3 Smalltalk.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb36\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2628 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw2 Magnitude Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-1 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb18\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex109\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asciilnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the ASCII encoding of the character.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2295\margrsxn1989\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 328      Character}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi-414\ri0\sb252\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb194\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 CharacterConstants}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Defines variables for some of the most frequently used characters (e.g., Space for\line \expndtw5 the space character, Lf for the line-feed character, etc.).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 digitValue: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the character representation of the digit anlnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw15\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 new}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Disallow the instantiation of characters because characters are immutable.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 value: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the character whose ASCII encoding matches anlnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 K. \i0 aCharacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true  if the  receiver ASCII value  is less  than  the  ASCII  value  of\line \expndtw3 aChararacter, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 < =* aChararacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver ASCII value is less than or equal to the ASCII value\line \expndtw3 of aChararacter, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li436\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 \'97\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0  aChararacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver ASCII value is equal to the ASCII value of aChararacter,\line \expndtw2 else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0\tx619 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 >{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw3 aChararacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver ASCII value is greater than the ASCII value of\line \expndtw3 aChararacter, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0\tx619 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 >{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw3\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0 \'99\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0  aChararacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver ASCII value is greater than or equal to the ASCII value\line \expndtw3 of aChararacter, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asciiValue}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the number corresponding to the ASCII encoding of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asLowerCase}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the lower case value of the receiver if it is a letter, else answer the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asUpperCase}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the upper case value of the receiver if it is a letter, else answer the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 deepCopy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a copy of the receiver with shallow copies of each instance variable. Because\line \expndtw5 characters are immutable (cannot instantiate a copy), answer the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2095\margrsxn2185\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 CharacterScanner      329}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb302\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 digitValue}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a number corresponding to the digit value of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb47\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 hash}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the integer hash.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 isAlphaNumeric}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is in the range of characters from 0 to 9 or in the range\line \expndtw6 from a to z or in the range from A to Z, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 isDigit}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is in the range of characters from 0 to 9, else answer\line \expndtw-2 false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 isLetter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is in the range of of characters from a and z or in the\line \expndtw5 range from A and Z, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 isLowerCase}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is in the range of characters from a to z, else answer\line \expndtw-2 false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 is Separator}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver character is either a space, tab, carriage-return, line-feed\line \expndtw4 or form-feed character, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 isUpperCase}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is in the range of character from A to Z, else answer\line \expndtw-2 false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 isVowel}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is any one of the characters a,A,e,E,i,I,o,0,u,U, else\line \expndtw2 answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 printOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Append the ASCII representation of the receiver to aStream.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 shallowCopy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a copy of the receiver which shares the receiver instance variables. Because\line \expndtw5 characters are immutable (cannot instantiate a copy), answer the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 storeOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Append the ASCII representation of the receiver to aStream from which the\line \expndtw4 receiver can be reconstructed.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb299\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 CharacterScanner}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa198\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 The function of this class is to convert characters represented by ASCII values into\line \expndtw3 display able bit patterns. It contains a font describing the bit patterns of all characters and\line \expndtw4 carries out the conversion operation by transferring bits from the font (as the source form)\line \expndtw5 to the destination form.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2106\margrsxn6080\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1220\colsr1397\colno2\colw1105 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 BitBlt Object}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2315\margrsxn1966\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa317 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 330      CharacterScanner}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2318\margrsxn6239\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1112\colsr1519\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\