3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 displayed.\line \b\expndtw6\fs22 textString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a String of characters to be displayed on the destination form.\line \b\expndtw0\fs22 width}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class BitBlt)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi-414\ri0\sb130\sa22\sl-320\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2034\margrsxn6523\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1483\colsr1148\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb169\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2034\margrsxn2268\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb162\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 blank: \b0 aPoint \b width: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Paint to the background color, the rectangle whose origin is aPoint, width is\line \expndtw6 anlnteger, and height is the font height.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 blankRestFrom: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Blank the bottom portion of the frame starting from anlnteger row.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 clipRect: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the clipping rectangle of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 display: \b0 aString \b at: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display the bit pattern of aString at aPoint in the frame of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 display: \b0 aString \b from: \b0 anlnteger \b at: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display the bit pattern of aString starting at index position anlnteger up to the last\line \expndtw4 character of the string at aPoint in the frame. The remaining line after the last\line character will be blanked.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 display: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li594\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 from: \b0 start \b to: \b0 stop \b at: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li788\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display the bit pattern of aString from index position start to stop at aPoint in the\line \expndtw4 frame of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 displayAU: \b0 aCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li590\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 from: \b0 firstLine \b to: \b0 lastLine \b at: \b0 columnlndex}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display the part of aCollection between firstLine and lastLine.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li590\fi-191\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 displayForm: \b0 aForm\line \b\expndtw10 at: \b0 aPoint \b rule: \b0 aRule}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display aForm at aPoint in the frame using aRule.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 font}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the current font used by the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2465\margrsxn1833\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 332      CharacterScanner}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb324\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw20\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 frame}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the framing rectangle of the receiver. Usually it is the same as the clipping\line \expndtw1 rectangle while the latter is sometimes changed to a smaller rectangle.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 gray: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Color aRectangle in the frame with gray tone.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 initialize: \b0 aRectangle \b font: \b0 aFont}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Initialize the instance variables of the receiver such that its clipping rectangle is\line \expndtw-2 aRectangle and the font is aFont. The destination form is assumed to be the display\line screen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li598\fi-191\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 initialize: \b0 aRectangle\line \b\expndtw8 font: \b0 aFont \b dest: \b0 aForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Initialize the instance variables of the receiver such that its clipping rectangle is\line \expndtw3 aRectangle, the font is aFont, and the destination form is aForm.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 recover: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Reverse the color of aRectangle in the frame.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 reframe: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Change the frame of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 reverse: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Reverse the color of aRectangle in the frame.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 setFont: \b0 aFont}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Change the current font to aFont.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 setForeColor: \b0 fColor \b backColor: \b0 bColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the foreground color to fColor and background color to bColor. They can be\line \expndtw3 either an integer color or a mask form.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 show: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li598\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 from: \b0 start \b at: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display the bit pattern of aString from index position start at aPoint in the frame\line of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb288\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-10\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Class}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri4\sb205\sa36\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Class is the superclass of all class classes (i.e. metaclasses) in Smalltalk. It provides the\line \expndtw1 common protocol for defining and accessing class variables and pool dictionaries. The\line \expndtw-1 subclass creation messages are implemented here as well. Every class is an instance of a\line metaclass of the same name. The class contains the instance methods while the metaclass\line \expndtw0 contains the class methods.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2469\margrsxn5480\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1216\colsr1397\colno2\colw1346 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Behavior Object\line \expndtw-6 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2153\margrsxn2131\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Class      333}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 classPool}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Dictionary of all the class variables defined by this class. The keys are}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 strings containing the class variable names and the values are the current values}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi392\ri5044\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 of the class variables,\line \expndtw20 comment}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi403\ri4986\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw-2\fs22 dictionary Array}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi407\ri4986\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 instances}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li400\fi414\ri4986\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \expndtw23 name}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi407\ri4986\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 sharedPools}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Array of symbols for the pool dictionary names referred to by this class.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 structure}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi403\ri4986\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 subclasses}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi403\ri4986\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw7\fs22 superclass}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li814\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 InstlndexedBit}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li400\fi410\ri4986\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 InstNumberMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi407\ri4990\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 InstPointerBit}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa212\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2156\margrsxn6404\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1479\colsr1148\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2153\margrsxn2131\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 sortBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a sort block for sorting classes alphabetically.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb198\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 addClassVarName: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Add a new class variable named aString to the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 addSharedPool: \b0 aSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Add the shared pool named aSymbol to the receiver shared pool references.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 classPool}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the dictionary containing the class variables defined in the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1281\margrsxn1937\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1073\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa299 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 334     Class}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1281\margrsxn1937\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw720\colsr346\colno2\colw7624\linebetcol \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 class VarNames}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer a Set of class variable names defined in the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 edit}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Open a ClassBrowser window on the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fileOutOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Append the class definition message for the receiver to aStream.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 initialize}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Initialize the class variables defined in the receiver. Subclasses usually override this\line \expndtw-3 message. The default is to set all class variables to nil.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw13\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 name}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer a String containing the receiver name.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 removeFromSystem}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Remove the receiver from Smalltalk. Report an error if there are any subclasses\line or instances of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 rename: aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Rename the receiver to aString.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 sharedPools}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer an Array of symbols of pool dictionary names referred to by the recevier.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 subclass: \b0 classSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li601\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 instance VariableNames\b0 : instance Variables}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi-94\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 classVariableNames: \b0 class Variables \b poolDictionaries: \b0 poolDictNames\line \expndtw-3 Create or modify the class classSymbol to be a subclass of the receiver with the\line \expndtw-4 specifed instance variables, class variables, and pool dictionaries.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 variableByteSubclass: \b0 classSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li605\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 classVariableNames: \b0 class Variables \b poolDictionaries: \b0 poolDictNames}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Create or modify the class classSymbol to be a variable byte subclass of the receiver\line \expndtw-4 with the specified class variables and pool dictionaries.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 variableSubclass: \b0 classSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li605\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 instance VariableNames: \b0 instance Variables}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi-101\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 classVariableNames: \b0 class Variables \b poolDictionaries: \b0 poolDictNames\line \expndtw-8 Create or modify the class classSymbol to be a variable subclass of the receiver with\line \expndtw-4 the specifed instance variables, class variables, and pool dictionaries.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb284\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 ClassBrowser}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Qass ClassBrowser implements a window on all the methods for a single class. Methods can\line \expndtw-9 be browsed, edited and cross-referenced. A ClassBrowser window consists of three panes. The\line \expndtw-4 first contains the type of methods being browsed (instance or class). The second contains\line \expndtw-6 the list of method selectors for the selected type. And the third contains the source code for\line \expndtw-4 the selected method. The window's label shows the class name being browsed.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2358\margrsxn6214\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\pard\plain \sb180\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2358\margrsxn6214\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1220\colsr1397\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Inherits From:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Object}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2043\margrsxn2252\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li5720\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa313 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 ClassHierarchyBrowser      335}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2050\margrsxn6511\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1108\colsr1519\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2043\margrsxn2252\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 browsedClass}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi389\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the class on which the browser was opened.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 selectedDictionary}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains browsedClass or browsedClass class, depending upon whether instance or}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 class methods are selected.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 selectedMethod}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa133\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the selector of the selected method, or nil if no method is selected.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2047\margrsxn6511\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1483\colsr1148\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi-414\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-320\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb22\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:\line \expndtw-1 Class Methods:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb662\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)\line (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2043\margrsxn2252\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb166\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 openOn: \b0 aClass}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Create a class browser window on aClass. Define the type, behavior and relative\line size of each pane and schedule the window.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb281\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 ClassHierarchyBrowser}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri7\sb209\sa36\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class ClassHierarchyBrowser implements a window on all the classes in Smalltalk/V. It\line \expndtw1 allows for class definitions and methods to be browsed and edited; the source code for a class\line \expndtw2 to be written to a file; and the senders and implementors of messages to be displayed. A\line \expndtw1 QassHierarchyBrowser window consists of five panes. The first contains the class hierarchy.\line The second contains the method selectors for the selected class. The third contains the source\line code for the selected method or the class definition method for the selected class. The fourth\line and fifth panes are mutually exclusive, containing the type of the method dictionary selected\line \expndtw3 (instance methods or class methods).}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2050\margrsxn6525\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1220\colsr1393\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Object\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2043\margrsxn2252\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb162\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 browsedClasses}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an OrderedCollection of strings of class names with the subclasses\line \expndtw4 indented to show the hierarchy.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 hiddenClasses}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Set of classes whose subclasses should not be displayed. These classes\line \expndtw6 have an ellipsis (...) appended to their name in the hierarchy.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2377\margrsxn1914\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 336      ClassHierarchyBrowser}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb320\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 instanceSelectedLast}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains true if the instance pane was selected last, false if the class pane selected}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 last.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 methodSelectedLast}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains true if a method selector was selected last, false if a class name was selected}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 last.\line \b\expndtw1\fs22 originalClasses}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the collection of classes passed as the argument to the openOn: message.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 selectedClass}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the most recently selected class, or nil if no class is selected.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 selectedMethod}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the most recently selected method selector, or nil if no method is selected.}\par \pard\plain\fs2\sa241\sl-1\slmult0\par\trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-223 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2030 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3189 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-396 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2030 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3189 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li295\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-425 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2030 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3189 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li486\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-331 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2030 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3189 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li486\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard\intbl\row \pard\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb220\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 openOn: \b0 aCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Create a class hierarchy browser window giving access to the classes in aCollection\line \expndtw3 and their subclasses.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb288\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 ClassReader}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A ClassReader supports Smalltalk source code reading and installation (compilation) from\line \expndtw3 a stream, and writing to a stream. The source code is in 'chunk' format (See Chapter 13,\line Maintaining Smalltalk/V, for a definition of chunk). A ClassReader is used for writing the\line entire source code of a class to a file, for reading a file to define a class, and for reading\line \expndtw1 portions of a file to selectively recover methods (for example, using the DiskBrowser to read\line \expndtw3 the change log).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb36\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2628 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw1 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2639 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb25\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 class}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the class to be worked on by the ClassReader.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi-414\ri0\sb137\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2046\margrsxn2234\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 Collection      337}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 CharacterConstants}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li799\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Defines variables for some of the most frequently used characters (e.g., Space for\line \expndtw5 the space character, Lf for the line-feed character, etc.).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 forClass: \b0 aClass}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer an instance of the receiver for aClass.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 filelnFrom: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Read chunks from aStream until an empty chunk (a single '!') is found. Compile\line \expndtw0 each chunk as a method for the class described by the receiver. Log the source code\line \expndtw5 of the method to the change log.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fileOutOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li799\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 File out all the methods for the class described by the receiver to aStream, in chunk\line \expndtw2 format.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Collection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri4\sb202\sa209\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Collection is the superclass of all the collection classes. It is an abstract class defining\line \expndtw3 the common protocol for all of its subclasses. Collections are the basic data structures used\line to store objects in groups in either a linear or nonlinear fashion (e.g. hashed). This class\line \expndtw0 provides the protocol to directly access (or store) a particular element in a collection, to access\line \expndtw3 all the elements of a collection in a particular order, or to perform some block of code for\line each element accessed.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2053\margrsxn2332\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1224\colsr1393\colno2\colw4906 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Array Bag Bitmap ByteArray CompiledMethod Dictionary\line \expndtw3 FileHandle FixedSizeCollection IdentityDictionary\line \expndtw2 IndexedCollection Interval MethodDictionary\line \expndtw4 OrderedCollection Process Set SortedCollection String\line Symbol SymbolSet SystemDictionary}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2046\margrsxn2234\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables: (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi-414\ri0\sb137\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb191\sa0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2304\margrsxn1984\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 338      Collection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 with: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a collection with only one element, anObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 with: \b0 firstObject \b with: \b0 secondObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a collection of two elements, firstObject and secondObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 with: \b0 firstObject \b with: \b0 secondObject \b with: \b0 thirdObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a collection of three elements, firstObject, secondObject, and thirdObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 with: \b0 firstObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li598\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 with: \b0 secondObject \b with: \b0 thirdObject \b with: \b0 fourthObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li788\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a collection of four elements, firstObject, secondObject, thirdObject, and\line fourthObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 add: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anObject. Add anObject to the receiver collection.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 addAU: \b0 aCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li796\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer aCollection. Add each element of aCoDection to the elements of the\line \expndtw1 receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asArray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer an Array containing all the elements of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asBag}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Bag containing the elements of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asOrderedCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer an OrderedCollection containing the elements of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asSet}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Set containing the elements of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asSortedCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a SortedCoUection containing the elements of the receiver sorted in\line \expndtw3 ascending order.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asSortedCollection: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a SortedCoUection containing the elements of the receiver sorted according\line \expndtw2 to aBlock.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 collect: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 For each element in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with that element as the\line \expndtw1 argument. Answer a new coUection containing the results as its elements from the\line aBlock evaluations.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 deepCopy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a copy of the receiver with shaUow copies of each element.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 detect: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the first element of the receiver that causes aBlock to evaluate to true (with\line \expndtw7 that element as the argument). If no such element is found, report an error.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2378\margrsxn2295\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Collection      339}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li22\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 detect: \b0 aBlock \b ifNone: \b0 exceptionBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li414\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the first element of the receiver that causes aBlock to evaluate to true (with\line \expndtw0 that element as the argument). If no such element is found, evaluate exceptionBlock\line \expndtw3 (with no arguments).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 do: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li414\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 For each element in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with, that element as the\line \expndtw5 argument. This method should be implemented in the class of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 includes: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver contains an element equal to anObject, else answer\line \expndtw-2 false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 inject: \b0 initialValue \b into: \b0 aBinaryBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li410\fi0\ri11\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 For each element in the receiver collection, evaluate aBinaryBlock with that\line \expndtw1 element as the argument. Starting with initialValue, the block is also provided with\line \expndtw-1 its own value from the previous evaluation. Answer this value at the end of the block\line \expndtw0 evaluations.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 isEmpty}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver collection contains no elements, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 notEmpty}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi0\ri11\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver collection contains one or more elements, else answer\line \expndtw-1 false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 occurrencesOf: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the number of elements contained in the receiver collection that are equal\line \expndtw3 to anObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 printOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Append the ASCII representation of the receiver to aStream.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 reject: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 For each element in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with that element as the\line \expndtw2 argument. Answer a new collection containing those elements of the receiver for\line which aBlock evaluates to false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw13\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 remove: anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li400\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anObject. Remove the element equal to anObject from the receiver\line \expndtw6 collection. If such an element is not found, report an error.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 remove: \b0 anObject \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li400\fi0\ri18\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anObject. Remove an element equal to anObject from the receiver\line \expndtw3 collection. If such an element is not found, evaluate aBlock (with no arguments).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 removeAH: \b0 aCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li396\fi0\ri22\sb4\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer aCollection. Remove all the elements contained in aCollection from the\line receiver collection.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb104\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 select: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li392\fi0\ri22\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 For each element in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with that element as the\line \expndtw2 argument. Answer a new collection containing those elements of the receiver for\line \expndtw3 which aBlock evaluates to true.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2381\margrsxn1918\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 340      Collection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb288\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 shallowCopy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a copy of the receiver which shares the receiver elements.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 storeOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Append the ASCII representation of the receiver to aStream from which the\line \expndtw5 receiver can be reinstantiated.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 ColorForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb198\sa18\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A ColorForm contains an array of bitmaps. All bits in the same location of each bitmap\line \expndtw4 collectively represent the color of the pixel at that location.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2385\margrsxn3225\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2372\colsr248\colno2\colw3679 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb18\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\