he memory.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2406\margrsxn5575\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2246\colsr371\colno2\colw1310 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Object\line \expndtw-4 NoMouseCursor}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2388\margrsxn1903\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb47\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 hotSpot}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point relative to the top left corner of the cursor shape which alligns\line \expndtw5 the cursor image to the cursor position on the display screen.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 image}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a String of the cursor image in the format required by the Microsoft mouse\line \expndtw2 when the mouse driver is loaded. Contains a Form of the cursor image when the\line \expndtw4 mouse driver is not loaded.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb216\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs