lain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 offset: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the cursor position to aPoint. Answer the new position.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2366\margrsxn1925\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 350     Date}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb284\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Date}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A Date represents a particular day since the start of the Julian calendar. Class Date defines\line \expndtw4 the protocol for creating, comparing, and computing dates.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2370\margrsxn1925\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx2614\posnegy32\absw1490\absh-875\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Magnitude Object\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb32\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line \expndtw3 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 day}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li788\fi0\ri22\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the number of days from January 1, 1901 up to the date represented by\line this instance.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 MonthNames}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Dictionary. The keys of the dictionary are instances of class Symbol\line \expndtw5 representing the month names in both the full and abbreviated form. For each of\line the keys, the corresponding value is an integer from 1 to 12 indicating the index\line \expndtw7 of the month in the year.\line \b\expndtw1\fs22 MonthStrings}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa212\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Dictionary. The keys of the dictionary are instances of class String\line \expndtw4 representing the month names in both the full and abbreviated form. For each of\line \expndtw3 the keys, the corresponding value is an instance of class Symbol representing the\line \expndtw6 name of the month in the abbreviated 3 character form.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2370\margrsxn6198\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1476\colsr1145\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2366\margrsxn1925\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 calendar For Month: \b0 aSymbol \b year: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a String containing the formatted calendar for the month name aSymbol\line \expndtw6 in the year anlnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 dateAndTimeNow}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer an Array of two elements. The first element is a Date representing the\line current date and the second element is a Time representing the current time.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw15\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 dayOfWeek: aSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a number from 1 to 7 indicating the weekday number for aSymbol (1\line \expndtw5 meaning Monday, to 7 meaning Sunday).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 daysInMonth: \b0 aSymbol \b for Year: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the total number of days for the month aSymbol in the year yInteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 daysInYear: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the total number of days for the year anlnteger.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2101\margrsxn2205\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Date      351}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb324\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 fromDays: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Date that is anlnteger number of days before or after January 1, 1901\line \expndtw6 depending on the sign of anlnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fromString: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Date specified by aString. aString contains first the day number then\line the month name and then the year separated with blanks.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 indexOfMonth: \b0 aSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a number from 1 to 12 indicating the month index for the aSymbol.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 leap Year: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the year anlnteger is a leap year, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 leapYearsTo: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the number of leap years from 1901 to the year number before anlnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 monthNameFromString: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Symbol for a month name corresponding to the month name in aString.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 nameOfDay: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the weekday name as a Symbol corresponding to the weekday index\line \expndtw6 anlnteger (Monday for index 1, to Sunday for index 7).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 nameOfMonth: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the month name as a Symbol corresponding to the month index anlnteger\line \expndtw5 (January for index 1, to December for index 12).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 newDay: \b0 dlnteger \b month: \b0 aSymbol \b year: \b0 ylnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Date of the day dlnteger in the month aSymbol for the year ylnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 newDay: \b0 dlnteger \b year: \b0 ylnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Date of the day dlnteger in the year ylnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 today}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the current date.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 < aDate}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is before aDate.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw25\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 <* aDate}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is before or the same as aDate.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li428\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 \'99\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0  aDate}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is the same as aDate.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 > aDate}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is after aDate.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 >\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0 \'ab\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0 * aDate}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0