rtb\cellx3190 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li464\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-295 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2052 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3190 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \pard\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb126\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 add: \b0 anAssociation}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anAssociation. Add anAssociation to the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 associationAt: \b0 aKey}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the Association whose key equals aKey from the receiver. If not found,\line \expndtw6 report an error.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 associationAt: \b0 aKey \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the Association whose key equals aKey from the receiver. If not found,\line \expndtw4 evaluate aBlock (with no arguments).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 associationsDo: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the receiver. For each key/value pair in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with\line \expndtw6 that pair as the argument.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 at: \b0 aKey}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the value of the key /value pair whose key equals aKey from the receiver.\line \expndtw6 If not found, report an error.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 at: \b0 aKey \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the value of the key/value pair whose key equals aKey from the receiver.\line \expndtw4 If not found, evaluate aBlock (with no arguments).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 at: \b0 aKey \b put: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anObject. If the receiver contains the key/value pair whose key equals\line \expndtw1 aKey, replace the value of the pair with anObject. Else add the aKey/anObject pair.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 deepCopy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a copy of the receiver with shallow copies of each element.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 do: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the receiver. For each value in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with that value\line \expndtw5 as the argument.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 includes: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver contains the key/value pair whose value equals\line \expndtw3 anObject, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 indudesKey: \b0 aKey}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver contains aKey, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 inspect}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Open a dictionary inspector window on the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2248\margrsxn2029\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 358     Dictionary}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 keyAtValue: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri25\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the key in the receiver whose paired value equals anObject. If not found,\line \expndtw-5 answer nil.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 keyAtValue: \b0 anObject \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri25\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the key in the receiver whose paired value equals anObject. If not found,\line \expndtw-4 evaluate aBlock (with no arguments).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 keys}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer a Set containing all the keys in the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 keysDo: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li796\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the receiver. For each key in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with the key\line as the argument.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 occurrencesOf: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the number of key/value pairs in the receiver, whose values are equal to\line anObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 remove: anObject \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Remove the key/value pair whose value is anObject from the receiver dictionary.\line \expndtw-4 This method reports an error since the values are not unique in a dictionary, the\line keys are.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 removeAssociation: \b0 anAssociation}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li796\fi0\ri18\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the receiver after anAssociation has been removed from it. If anAssociation\line \expndtw-1 is not in the receiver, report an error.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 removeKey: \b0 aKey}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the receiver with the key/value pair whose key equals aKey removed. If\line \expndtw-1 such a pair is not found, report an error.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 removeKey: \b0 aKey \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer aKey. Remove the key/value pair whose key equals aKey from the\line \expndtw-3 receiver. If such a pair is not found, evaluate aBlock (with no arguments).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 select: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li785\fi0\ri11\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 For each key/value pair in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with the value part of the\line \expndtw-5 pair as the argument. Answer a new object containing those key/value pairs for\line which aBlock evaluates to true.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 shallowCopy}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer a copy of the receiver which shares the receiver elements.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 storeOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li788\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Append the ASCII representation of the receiver to aStream from which the\line receiver can be reinstantiated.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 values}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer a Bag containing all the values of the key/value pairs in the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1983\margrsxn2301\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 Directory      359}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb277\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Dictionarylnspector}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li4\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Dictionarylnspector implements a window on a dictionary which allows the entries of\line a dictionary to be viewed and changed. The left list pane displays the ASCII representation\line \expndtw2 of all the dictionary keys. The right text pane displays an ASCII representation of the value\line \expndtw3 associated with the selected key.}\par \pard\plain\fs2\sa245\sl-1\slmult0\par\trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-302 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx1354 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx1808 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb