ter and a path name string. Files\line \expndtw1 are generally described in terms of a directory and a file name. A FileStream may be created\line \expndtw4 by sending the message file: or newFile: to a Directory.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb40\sa0\sl-436\slmult0\tx2632 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw0 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0\tx2642 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 drive}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi400\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Character representing the disk drive letter.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 pathName}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a String representing the path name (from the root directory) of the\line \expndtw5 directory, not including the drive letter.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2322\margrsxn1958\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 360     Directory}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb295\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 volumeLabel}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a String representing the label of the disk containing the directory