mbining\line \expndtw6 aForm with the destination using anlnteger as the rule.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 fill: \b0 aForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tile the receiver with aForm.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 fill: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li601\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 clippingBox: \b0 clipRectangle \b rule: \b0 anlnteger \b mask: \b0 aForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri25\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 TUe the receiver with aForm bounded by clipRectangle. The combination rule is\line \expndtw4 anlnteger.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2370\margrsxn1928\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 368     DisplayMedium}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 fill: \b0 aRectangle \b rule: \b0 anlnteger mask: aForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Tile the receiver with aForm bounded by aRectangle. The combination rule is\line \expndtw1 specified by anlnteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw17\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 gray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Paint the receiver gray.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3