cchs0\lang1033\fs22 writeBuffer: \b0 aString \b ofSize: \b0 n \b atPosition: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Write the first n bytes of aString into the receiver file at position aninteger.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb281\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 FileHandle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb216\sa216\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A FileHandle is an Array of two bytes. Its sixteen bit value represents a DOS file handle\line \expndtw4 number which is used to access files.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2423\margrsxn2755\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1224\colsr1390\colno2\colw4118 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Byte Array FixedSizeCollection IndexedCollection\line \expndtw1 Collection Object}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2281\margrsxn2014\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 FileStream      377}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb144\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2632 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa47\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 This class contains indexed byte values.\line \expndtw0 Class Variables:}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2284\margrsxn6273\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1576\colsr1055\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 FileHandles}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li814\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 ***}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb108\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:\line Class Methods:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb655\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2281\margrsxn2014\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb43\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 open: \b0 aString \b in: \b0 aDirectory}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a file handle for an opened file named aString in aDirectory.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb194\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 close}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Close the file identified by the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 endByte}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the size in bytes of the file identified by the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 openln: \b0 fileName}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer an opened FileHandle for the file named fileName.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 readlnto: \b0 aString \b atPosition: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Read a page or less (if at end of file) at position anlnteger modulo aString size from\line \expndtw6 the receiver file into aString. Answer the number bytes read.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 writeFrom: \b0 aString \b toPosition: \b0 anlnteger \b for: \b0 size}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Write size bytes of aString to the receiver file at position anlnteger modulo aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb14\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex124\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 size.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb299\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 FileStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri7\sb209\sa36\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A FileStream allows streaming over the characters of files for read and write access. It has\line an internal record of the current position. It has messages to read and write the character(s)\line at the current position and cause the position to be advanced. Messages are defined for\line changing the stream position, so that random access is possible. A FileStream accesses its\line file in pages, and actually streams across the string object containing the current file page.\line \expndtw0 Note that because writes are buffered, a flush or close message must be sent to the FileStream\line \expndtw5 to insure that the written data is physically recorded.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2284\margrsxn3051\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1224\colsr1390\colno2\colw3960 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line \expndtw3 Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 ReadWriteStream WriteStream Stream Object\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2425\margrsxn1863\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 378     FileStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 collection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi410\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Stream)\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 file}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi392\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a File being streamed over.\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 lastByte}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the high water mark for the file. For file streams, writeLimit contains the}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 high water mark for the current buffer.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 lineDelimiter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a character, either carriage-return or line-feed. File lines are delimited}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi400\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 by either the carriage-return line-feed pair, or line-feed only.\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 pageStart}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the position of the current buffer relative to the beginning of the file. A}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 FileStream position is pageStart + position.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 position}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi414\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Stream)\line \b\expndtw6 readLJmit}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi410\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Stream)\line \b\expndtw0\fs22 writeLimit}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi407\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class WriteStream)\line \b\expndtw1\fs22 writtenOn}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Boolean indicating whether or not the current file page buffer has been}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 changed.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi-410\ri0\sb130\sa0\sl-320\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb191\