439\slmult0\tx2621 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A Font defines the bitmap patterns and attributes of all characters to be displayed.\line Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw1 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2632 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 basePoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point whose x is currently undefined and y is the base line relative to}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 the top of the font. Thus the ascent of the font is y and the descent of the font is}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi410\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (font height - y).\line \b\fs22 charSize}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point whose x and y coordinates are the width and height of each}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 character in the font.\line \b\expndtw0\fs22 endChar}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Integer representing the ASCII value of the last character in the font.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 fixedWidth}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Boolean which is true if each character has fixed width; is false otherwise.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2352\margrsxn1950\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 384     Font}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 glyphs}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Form whose contents are the bit patterns of all characters in the font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 The image of each character is appended horizontally. Thus the height of the Form}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li407\fi392\ri11\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 is the same as that of each character and the width is the aggregate of all characters.\line \b\fs22 startChar}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li410\fi385\ri11\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Integer representing the ASCII value of the first character in the font.\line \b\expndtw7\fs22 xTable}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Array of Integers specifying the x coordinate of each character within}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 the glyphs.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 EightLine}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the eight line high font.\line \b\expndtw0\fs22 FourteenLJne}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi385\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the fourteen line high font.\line \b\fs22 SixteenLine}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa198\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the sixteen line high font.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2356\margrsxn6201\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1483\colsr1148\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2352\margrsxn1950\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 eightLJne}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the 8 pixel height font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fourteenLine}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the 14 pixel height font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 setSysFont: \b0 aFont}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the global system font to aFont.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 sixteenLine}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the 16 pixel height font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 basePoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Point where the y-coordinate is the ascent of the font. Note: charSize y\line \expndtw5 - basePoint y is the descent.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 charSize}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Point, the pixel extent of the largest character in the font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 char Width: \b0 aCharacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the width of aCharacter.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fixedWidth}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the font is of fixed width, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 getlndex: \b0 aCharacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the index of aCharacter into xTable.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2293\margrsxn1995\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 Form      385}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb302\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 glyphs}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the form containing the image of each character.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 height}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the height of the font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 installFixedSize: \b0 glyphForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi-202\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 charSize: \b0 aPoint \b startChar: \b0 slnteger \b endChar: \b0 elnteger \b basePoint: \b0 bPoint\line \expndtw4\fs20 Install a font with fixed size characters. The bit pattern of all the characters is in\line \expndtw6 glyphForm. The width and height of each character is specified by aPoint. The\line \expndtw5 slnteger and elnteger are the ASCII values of the first and last characters in the\line font. The base point is specified by bPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 string Width: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Return the pixel width of aString written in the receiver font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 width}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the width of the widest character in the font.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-12\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Form}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A Form contains a bit map and other instance variables to describe the bit map as a two\line \expndtw3 dimensional array of bits. Class Form provides the protocol to initialize a Form or change\line \expndtw4 the size of a Form. The contents of a Form can be changed by using the messages defined\line \expndtw3 in class BitBlt and its subclasses.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2689\margrsxn1998\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx-392\posnegy43\absw2250\absh-1616\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line \expndtw3 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi-396\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-320\slmult0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx-392\posnegy43\absw2250\absh-1616\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 bits}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li2225\fi0\ri0\sb40\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 DisplayMedium DisplayObject Object\line \expndtw-1 BiColorForm Color Form ColorScreen Display Screen}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the bit map.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 byteWidth}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the witdth of the bit map as an integral number of bytes (e.g., a bit width}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 of 9 has a byte width of 2).\line \b\fs22 deviceType}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an integer indicating the type of hardware that the form describes.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Currently defined forms are: 0 for main memory and 1 for the display screen}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi400\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 memory.\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 height}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the height of the bit map in bits.\line \b\expndtw6\fs22 offset}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point which is the origin of the form relative to the origin of the display}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 screen.\line \b\fs22 width}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the width of the bit map in bits.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2374\margrsxn1917\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 386      Form}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 BlackMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi385\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a mask form whose contents are all black.\line \b\expndtw1\fs22 DarkGrayMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi385\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a mask form whose contents are all dark gray.\line \b\expndtw-2\fs22 GrayMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a mask form whose contents are all gray.\line \b\expndtw0\fs22 LightGrayMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a mask form whose contents are all light gray.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 PrinterMode}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi389\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a String representing the printer graphics mode (e.g.: Esc   \b K).\line \expndtw1\fs22 WhiteMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb14\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a mask form whose contents are all white.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri