w-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 backColor: \b0 aColor}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Set the background color to aColor. For Forms do nothing.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 bitmap}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the bitmap of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 byteValueAt: \b0 aPoint \b put: \b0 aByte}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Replace the byte at the position aPoint by aByte.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 byteValueAtX: \b0 xlnteger Y: ylnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the byte at the position specified by the point (xlnteger @ ylnteger).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 compatibleForm}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the class of internal form most similar to the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 compatibleMask}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the class of mask form most suitable for use with the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 copy: \b0 aRect