 \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Copy the receiver contents from the display screen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fromDisplay: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Copy the receiver contents from aRectangle area of the display screen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 height}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the height of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 magnify: \b0 aRectangle \b by: \b0 scale}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li781\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer a form containing the image of aRectangle in the receiver magnified by\line scale whose x is the horizontal magnifying factor and y the vertical factor.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li385\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 offset}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li781\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the offset of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li382\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 offset: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li781\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Change the offset of the receiver to aPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li382\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 outputToPrinter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Output the contents of the receiver to the printer sideways (landscape).}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2100\margrsxn2181\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Fraction     389}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb288\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 outputToPrinterUpright}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Output the contents of the receiver to the printer (with 8 pins) upright (portrait).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb47\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 reverse}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li814\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Reverse the bit map of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 width}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the width of the receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 width: \b0 winteger \b height: \b0 hinteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Change the receiver width to winteger and height to hinteger, and allocate its\line \expndtw0 bitmap with the appropriate size.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 width: \b0 winteger \b height: \b0 hinteger \b initialByte: \b0 aByte}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Change the receiver width to winteger and height to hinteger, and initialize every\line \expndtw2 byte in the bitmap to aByte.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb259\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs26 Fraction}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li4\fi0\ri7\sb198\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Qass Fraction defines the protocol to perform arithmetic operations on rational numbers.\line \expndtw-1 A Fraction consists of a numerator denominator pair each of which is an integer so that no\line \expndtw0 precision is lost during computations.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb29\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2628 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw0 Number Magnitude Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-5 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 denominator}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an integer representing the denominator,\line \expndtw21 numerator}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an integer representing the numerator.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li418\fi-418\ri0\sb130\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-6 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb191\sa0\tx2632 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-6 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw15\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 numerator: n \b denominator: \b0 d}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer   an   instance   of  class   Fraction   and   initialize   both   numerator   and\line \expndtw1 denominatior instance variables to n and d respectively.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 * aNumber}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex104\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the result of multiplying the receiver by aNumber.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2275\margrsxn2016\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-680\shptop10757\shpright-680\shpbottom11671\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 8890}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 390      Fraction}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li446\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 + \i0 aNumber}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\c