 \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is equal to aNumber, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li421\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0\tx626 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 >{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }aNumber}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is greater than aNumber, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li421\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\tx626 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 >{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-1\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f3\cchs0 \'97\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0  aNumber}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver is greater than or equal to aNumber, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li428\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 \\\\ aNumber}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the integer remainder after dividing the receiver by aNumber with\line \expndtw1 truncation towards negative infinity.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 asFloat}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the receiver as a floating point number.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 denominator}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex103\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the denominator of the receiver.}\par \par