window consists of two panes. The left pane contains\line \expndtw4 the names (for the named instance variables) and/or numbers (for the indexed instance\line \expndtw3 variables). The right pane contains the ASCII representation of the value of the selected\line \expndtw2 instance variable. The left pane menu allows the opening of a new inspector on the selected\line instance variable. The right pane menu has all the text editing functions. The 'save' function\line \expndtw5 replaces the value of the selected instance variable by the evaluated pane contents.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2065\margrsxn4722\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1224\colsr1390\colno2\colw2509 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Debugger Dictionarylnspector}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2061\margrsxn2230\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb198\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 instlndex}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the index of the selected entry in the list pane. If no entry is selected,}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 instlndex contains 1 representing self (the object being inspected).\line \b\charscalex116\expndtw-1\fs22 instlist}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an OrderedCollection of strings to be displayed in the list pane which are}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 the names and/or numbers of the inspected object.\line \b\fs22 instPane}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the ListPane which displays the list of inspected object instance variable}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 names and/or numbers.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the inspected object.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi-410\ri0\sb137\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2444\margrsxn1836\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-331 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2038 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3197 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 402      Inspector}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-475 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2038 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3197 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\cell \pard \plain \