eptionBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li799\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa198\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Compile the Prolog method: ('Doit ', aString) in aClass. If the method compiles\line \expndtw5 correctly, answer: doitReceiver Doit. If not, send the messages: requestor\line \expndtw3 compilerError: errorString at: position in: aString. exceptionBlock value. In any\line \expndtw6 case remove the selector #Doit from aClass' method dictionary.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2131\margrsxn6433\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1515\colsr1109\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2121\margrsxn2167\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li22\fi0\ri0\sb295\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-11\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 ListPane}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li4\fi0\ri11\sb209\sa32\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class ListPane provides functions to display and scroll a portion of the data held by the pane.\line \expndtw3 The data is represented as an indexed collection of strings. When one of the strings in the\line \expndtw5 collection is selected, either the selected string or its index in the list is passed to the\line \expndtw3 application model for further processing.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2131\margrsxn5325\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2246\colsr371\colno2\colw1836 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\s