100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 CharacterConstants}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Defines variables for some of the most frequently used characters (e.g., Space for\line \expndtw5 the space character, Lf for the line-feed character, etc.).\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 FunctionKeys}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Defines variables for the function key codes (of class Character) input from the\line \expndtw3 keyboard or mouse.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 colors: \b0 colorArray \b selectors: \b0 selectorArray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a menu with colorArray for the items, selectorArray for actions.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 labelArray: \b0 labelArray \b lines: \b0 lineArray \b selectors: \b0 selectorArray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a menu with labelArray for the items, selectorArray for actions, and lines\line \expndtw6 drawn under the item numbers contained in lineArray.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb90\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 labels: \b0 aString \b lines: \b0 lineArray \b selectors: \b0 selectorArray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a menu with aString for the items, selectorArray for actions, and lines\line drawn under the item numbers contained in lineArray.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 message: \b0 aString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display aString as a one line menu.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 popUpAt: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pop up menu at aPoint, give it control, and answer the user response or nil if no\line \expndtw-1 response.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 popUpAt: \b0 aPoint \b for: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pop up menu at aPoint, give it control, and send response to anObject.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2191\margrsxn2083\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 MetaClass      413}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li22\fi0\ri0\sb277\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-11\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Message}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi0\ri4\sb212\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Message defines a data structure with an Array of message arguments and a message\line \expndtw1 selector to describe a Smalltalk message. When an undefined message is encountered during\line execution, the virtual machine passes an instance of class Message describing the undefined\line \expndtw3 message to the method 'doesNotUnderstand:' in class Object which in turn displays an\line \expndtw4 appropriate error message in the walkback window.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb36\sa0\sl-436\slmult0\tx2632 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw2 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0\tx2642 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-1 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb47\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 arguments}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Array which contains the message arguments.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 selector}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the message selector.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li421\fi-410\ri0\sb133\sa18\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2198\margrsxn6356\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1522\colsr1112\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:\line \expndtw0 Class Methods:\line \expndtw2 Instance Methods:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)\line (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2191\margrsxn2083\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb22\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 arguments}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the arguments array for the message.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 arguments: \b0 an Array}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the arguments array for the message.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selector}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the message selector.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selector: \b0 aSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the message selector.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li25\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 MetaClass}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa194\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class MetaClass is the class of all metaclasses (e.g., of Array). It contains the common\line \expndtw2 protocol for creating classes. Every metaclass has exactly one instance which is the class of\line \expndtw3 the same name (e.g., Point is the only instance of Point class). The metaclass contains the\line class methods while class contains the instance methods. Metaclasses are referred to by\line \expndtw5 sending the message 'class' to the class.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2205\margrsxn5748\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1220\colsr1393\colno2\colw1342 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Behavior Object}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2564\margrsxn1730\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa317 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 414     MetaClass}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2572\margrsxn5985\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2250\colsr382\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex102\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex102\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex102\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2564\margrsxn1730\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex102\expndtw19\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 comment}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi410\ri4968\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex102\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\charscalex100\fs22 dictionary Array}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi410\ri4968\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex102\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Behavior)\line \b\charscalex100\expndtw