ch class. For each dictionary entry, the key is a message selector symbol and\line \expndtw1 the associated value is a compiled method. Any updates to an instance of this class cause the\line method cache to be flushed, so that a subsequent method lookup will use the updated method\line dictionaries.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2284\margrsxn2677\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2246\colsr367\colno2\colw4334 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 IdentityDictionary Dictionary Set Collection Object\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2277\margrsxn2015\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb47\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 contents}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li403\fi407\ri5436\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Set)\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 elementCount}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li400\fi410\ri5436\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Set)\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 reserved}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Reserved for future use.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex1