fs22 under}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Form which is a copy of the screen image under the cursor. It is used}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 to hide the cursor.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 ConditionShown}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Boolean: if false it means that the cursor has been hidden during a}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 previous conditional hide operation; if true it means that the cursor remained shown}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 during the conditional hide operation.\line \b\expndtw-1\fs22 NoMouse}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi407\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class CursorManager)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 Position}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class CursorManager)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Me