t will be adjusted by\line \expndtw3 the global variable Aspect.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 fillAt: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li400\fi0\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Color all pixels that are connected to aPoint and have the same color as that of\line \expndtw6 aPoint with the pattern contained in the mask form.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 frame}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the clipping rectangle of the pen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 frame: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the clipping rectangle to aRectangle.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 go: \b0 anlnteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li396\fi0\ri25\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Move the pen for the distance anlnteger number of pixels in the current direction.\line \expndtw3 The y-axis is adjusted by Aspect.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb79\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 goto: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Move the pen to aPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 gray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charsca