033\fs20 move or a frame operation.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Window ActivateKey}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Dispatcher)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2385\margrsxn1914\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 440     PointDispatcher}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 CharacterConstants}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Defines variables for some of the most frequently used characters (e.g., Space for\line \expndtw5 the space character, Lf for the line-feed character, etc.).\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 FunctionKeys}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri11\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Defines variables for the function key codes (of class Character) input from the\line \expndtw3 keyboard or mouse.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 cornerFromUserOfOrigin: \b0 aPoint \b minExtent: \b0 extent}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li803\fi0\ri14\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a Rectangle which resizes a rectangle with aPoint as the origin and extent\line \expndtw5 as the minimum extent.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw14\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 new}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a new initialized PointDispatcher.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 pointFromUserDisplaying: \b0 aRectangle \b offset: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li792\fi0\ri11\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Display a rectangle of size box which may be moved by the user to the desired\line \expndtw-1 position. Answer the top left corner of the rectangle when the user selects a position.\line \expndtw6 'aPoint' is the offset between the cursor and the origin of aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 drawBox: \b0 aRect}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Draw a border around aRect.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li25\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-10\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Process}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri7\sb209\sa25\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A Process is an object representing a sequence of Smalltalk computations. The computations\line \expndtw2 are performed by objects sending messages to other objects and waiting for the results. The\line \expndtw3 process describes the current execution state, including the stack of unanswered messages.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2395\margrsxn2328\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2246\colsr371\colno2\colw4568 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb14\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-443\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 OrderedCollection IndexedCollection Collection Object\line \expndtw-1 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2385\margrsxn1914\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 contents}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class OrderedCollection)\line \b\expndtw6\fs22 debugger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the debugger window associated with the process if it is being debugged,}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 or nil if not debugged.\line \b\fs22 endPosition}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi410\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class OrderedCollection)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 frameBias}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\s