se}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 is requested, else it is set to false.\line \b\expndtw7\fs22 exitBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a block of code with no arguments. The block, when evaluated, answers}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 a result and exits the Prompter.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 hiddenArea}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Form containing a copy of the display screen image underneath the}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi403\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Prompter window.\line \b\expndtw3\fs22 reply}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the result of the Prompter. It is a String if the answer is not evaluated,}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi400\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 else it is the resulting object of evaluating the String entered by the user.\line \b\expndtw6\fs22 replyPane}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the TextPane of the Prompter.\line \b\fs22 withBlank}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Boolean. If true then accept the user input as is, else trim leading and}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0