receiver and advance the stream position.\line \expndtw6 Report an error if the receiver stream is positioned at end.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 nextByte}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the next byte accessible by the receiver and advance the stream position.\line \expndtw6 Report an error if the stream is positioned at end.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 nextPut: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Write anObject to the receiver stream. Answer anObject.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb76\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 nextPutAU: \b0 aCollection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Write each of the objects in aCollection to the receiver stream. Answer aCollection.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 setToEnd}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the position of the receiver stream to the end.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2077\margrsxn2222\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 448      ReadWriteStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb292\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 truncate}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the size of the receiver stream to its current position.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb288\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 Rectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri18\sb202\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A Rectangle represents a rectangular area (frequently used to define a subarea of a Form).\line \expndtw5 A Rectangle can be described by an origin (top left corner) and a corner (bottom right\line \expndtw2 corner) point, or by an origin and an extent point, where the extent describes the width and\line \expndtw4 height of the rectangle.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb36\sa0\sl-436\slmult0\tx2621 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw1 Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0\tx2628 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 corner}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi400\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point describing the bottom right corner.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 origin}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point describing the top left corner.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi-414\ri0\sb137\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\pa