eger representing the number of signal messages minus the number\line \expndtw5 of wait messages sent to the semaphore during its entire lifetime.\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 waitingProcesses}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an OrderedCollection of processes that have sent the message wait to the\line \expndtw3 semaphore without a corresponding signal message.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2368\margrsxn1908\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi-410\ri0\sb126\sa0\sl-324\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20\pvpara\phcol\posnegx2628\posnegy140\absw0\absh-231\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb187\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi-392\ri0\sb137\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:\line \b\expndtw16 new}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a new semaphore with empty waiting queue and zero signal count.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 hasSignals}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if there have been more signals than waits, else answer false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 signal}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Increment the receiver's signal count.  If there are processes waiting on the\line \expndtw4 semaphore, resume the longest waiting. Upon exit, interrupts are always enabled}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 wait}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-223\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Force the current process to be suspended until the receiver semaphore is signalled.\line \expndtw4 Upon exit, interrupts are always enabled}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb270\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs26 Set}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb191\sa43\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A Set represents an unordered collection of objects with no external keys. All elements of\line a Set are unique, i.e., duplicates are not maintained. Sets are hashed for rapid searching.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2368\margrsxn2866\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1224\colsr1386\colno2\colw4064 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb151\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Collection Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb209\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Dictionary IdentityDictionary MethodDictionary\line \expndtw4 SymbolSet SystemDictionary}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2202\margrsx