 capacity of aninteger elements.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb198\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 add: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anObject. Add anObject to the receiver if the receiver does not already\line \expndtw4 contain it.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 at: \b0 aninteger}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Access the element at index position aninteger in the receiver. This method reports\line \expndtw5 an error since sets cannot be indexed.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 at: \b0 aninteger \b put: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Replace the element at index position aninteger in the receiver with anObject. This\line \expndtw5 method reports an error since sets are not indexable.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 do: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the receiver. For each element in the receiver, evaluate aBlock with that\line \expndtw5 element as the argument.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 includes: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer true if the receiver includes anObject as one of its elements, else answer\line \expndtw-1 false.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 occurrencesOf: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li792\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer 1 if the receiver includes anObject as \i one \i0 of its elements, else answer zero.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li389\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 remove: anObject \b ifAbsent: \b0 aBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa94\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer anObject. Remove the element anObject from the receiver collection. If\line \expndtw0 anObject is not an element of the receiver, aBlock is evaluated (with no arguments).}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2598\margrsxn3980\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw720\colsr0\colno2\colw4939 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 size}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the number of elements contained in the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2197\margrsxn2079\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li6142\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa212 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 SortedCoUection     455}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2208\margrsxn2126\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1353\colsr5501\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat