chs0\lang1033\fs20 Replace the characters of the receiver at index positions start through stop with\line consecutive characters of aString beginning at index position repStart. Answer the\line \expndtw1 receiver.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi0\ri0\sb97\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 replaceFrom: \b0 start \b to: \b0 stop \b withObject: \b0 aCharacter}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li788\fi0\ri18\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Replace the characters of the receiver at index positions start through stop with\line \expndtw3 aCharacter. Answer aCharacter.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 size}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li788\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the size of the receiver string.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 storeOn: \b0 aStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li785\fi0\ri14\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Append the ASCII representation of the receiver to aStream from which the\line \expndtw5 receiver can be reinstantiated.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi0\ri0\sb68\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 stringHash}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li785\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer the integer hash value for the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2183\margrsxn2101\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 StringModel      463}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb328\sa0\sl-216\slmu