rscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-425 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2412 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx4414 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li108\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-446 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2412 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx4414 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li108\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (None)}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-288 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2412 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx4414 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Instance Methods:}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f3\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \pard\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb112\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 species}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer class Set as the species of SymbolSet.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb281\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 SystemDictionary}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri14\sb205\sa29\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 A SystemDictionary contains all the global variables. There is only one instance of class\line SystemDictionary which may be referred to by the name Smalltalk. Each global variable is\line \expndtw3 represented by an Association. The key is a Symbol containing the global variable name\line (beginning with an upper-case character). The associated value contains the value of the\line \expndtw0 global variable. Class SystemDictionary also defines the protocol for system utility functions.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2095\margrsxn4465\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1224\colsr1393\colno2\colw2732 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:\line Inherited By:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Dictionary Set Collection Object\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2489\margrsxn1802\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 470     SystemDictionary}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb310\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 contents}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi407\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Set)\line \b\fs22 elementCount}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li810\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Set)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi-410\ri0\sb133\sa0\sl-320\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb187\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:}\par \pard \