rom: \b0 aFilePathName}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Load a user primitive module from file aFilePathName.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 sendersOf: \b0 aSymbol}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pop-up an senders window for selector aSymbol.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 startUp}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Initiate a Smalltalk/V session by filing in the 'go' file.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2275\margrsxn2016\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri18\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 TerminalStream      471}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb338\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 unusedMemory}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer an integer which is the number of bytes of unused memory available for\line \expndtw1 object storage.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb284\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 TerminalStream}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri11\sb209\sa32\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class TerminalStream defines the streaming protocol to and from the terminal. There is a\line \expndtw7 global variable Terminal which is the instance of TerminalStream used throughout\line \expndtw1 Smalltalk/V. Output to a TerminalStream writes characters on the display screen, input from\line \expndtw3 TerminalStream returns user input from the keyboard and mouse. TerminalStream uses a\line \expndtw6 finite state machine to decode the user input from InputEvent.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2283\margrsxn3057\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2250\colsr371\colno2\colw3949 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-436\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 ReadWriteStream WriteStream Stream Object\line \expndtw-3 (None)}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2275\margrsxn2016\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 collection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Stream)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 mouseOffset}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the cursor location each time the right mouse button is pressed. When}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 scrolling is detected, this position is used as the scrolling start position.\line \b\fs22 mouseTime}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\