nd of the text to appear on the display screen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li374\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 forceSelectionOntoDisplay}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li778\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Force the origin of the selection to appear on the display screen.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li374\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 formCoordinates: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li767\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Convert string coordinates to form coordinates.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li371\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 frame}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li770\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Answer the receiver frame.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li374\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex122\expndtw-2\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 initialize}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li767\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Initialize the receiver.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2203\margrsxn2081\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 TextSelection     477}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb324\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 reframe: \b0 aRectangle}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Change the frame of the receiver pane to aRectagle.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb50\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selectAfter: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Place the selection after aPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selectAU}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Select the entire text of the pane.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selectAtEnd}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Place the gap selection at the end of the text.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selectBefore: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Place the gap selection before aPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selectedString}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a String containing the text currently selected.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 selectFrom: \b0 startPoint \b to: \b0 endPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Set the selection to the rectangle described by the origin startPoint and the corner\line endPoint.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb72\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Answer a TextSelection describing the current selection.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 selectTo: \b0 aPoint}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Extend the selection to aPoint either before or after the original one.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 showSelection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Make the selection visible.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li410\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 show Window}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Redraw the contents of the receiver pane.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb58\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 update}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Refresh the pane area on the display screen through the model.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi0\ri0\sb86\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw10\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 update: \b0 anObject}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li803\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 The model has changed. If anObject is a TextSelection, display it, else pass it up\line \expndtw1 to superclass.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb281\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 TextSelection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri11\sb212\sa187\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 In a TextPane, the text is represented as an OrderedCollection of Strings. It can be looked\line \expndtw1 upon as a two dimensional array. The position of each character can be identified by a Point\line \expndtw0 whose x coordinate (column) is the index within the String and y coordinate (row) is the index\line \expndtw5 in the OrderedCollection. When a selection is made in the TextPane, the selection is\line \expndtw4 represented internally as two points: the positions of the first and last characters included\line \expndtw3 in the selection. In the case of a gap selection, the column of the second point will be one\line less than the first while their rows are the same. Besides remembering these two points, a\line \expndtw4 TextSelection also understands all the messages for manipulating the selection.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2210\margrsxn6368\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1220\colsr1390\colno2\colw720 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb18\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Object}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2262\margrsxn2036\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 478      TextSelection}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb324\sa0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-1 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb202\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb94\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 begin}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point representing the position of the first character in the selection.\line \b\expndtw14 end}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi396\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point representing the position of the last character in the selection.\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 extendOrigin}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li396\fi396\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point indication the starting position when a selection is being extended.\line \b\expndtw5\fs22 pane}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi389\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains the Pane that this selection belongs to.  .\line \b\expndtw7\fs22 selectFlag}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Boolean which is true when the selection is being shown; false when it}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li799\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 is not shown.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li414\fi-410\ri0\sb140\sa0\sl-317\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Variables:\line \expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb191\sa0\tx2635 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Pool Dictionaries:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Class Methods:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb83\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw14\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 new}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\ex