\b\expndtw4\fs22 framingBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pane)\line \b\expndtw1\fs22 iconArray}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi392\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains an Array of two arrays of icons on the left and right of the window label.\line \b\expndtw13 label}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi392\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Form whose content is an image of the window label.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 minimumSize}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi392\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Contains a Point describing the minimum width and height of the window.\line \b\expndtw2\fs22 model}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li392\fi410\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pane)\line \b\expndtw4\fs22 paneMenuSelector}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li806\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pane)}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2219\margrsxn2083\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs14 TopPane      483}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi0\ri0\sb241\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 paneScanner}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 (From class Pane)\line \b\expndtw3 previousFrame}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li796\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-220\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\f