il.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb284\sa0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs24 WildPattern}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 An instance of WildPattern contains a finite state pattern for efficient matching which\line \expndtw2 includes at least one wild card character. The wild card character will match zero or more\line \expndtw6 elements in the matching collection until the rest of the pattern is matched or the end of\line \expndtw4 the matching collection is reached.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb32\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2621 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherits From:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw6 Pattern Object}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0\tx2632 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Inherited By:{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-2 (None)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Named Instance Variables:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw11\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 fail}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li400\fi414\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pattern)\line \b\charscalex113\expndtw2 first}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li407\fi407\ri0\sb4\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pattern)\line \b\charscalex113\expndtw-1 input}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi407\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-216\slmult0 \f3\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 (From class Pattern)\line \b\charscalex113\expndtw1 matchBlock}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li403\fi414\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-216\slmult